{"seq":2,"slug":"the-architecture-of-computing","title":"计算的架构：五大部件与冯·诺依曼瓶颈","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/john-von-neumann/ideas-and-methods/the-stored-program/the-architecture-of-computing","wordCount":1483,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"计算的架构-五大部件与冯-诺依曼瓶颈\">计算的架构：五大部件与冯·诺依曼瓶颈</h1><p>如果说&quot;程序即数据&quot;是一个理念，那么如何用电子元件把这个理念组织成一台能工作的机器，则是冯·诺依曼在《EDVAC 报告草案》里给出的工程答案。他没有从晶体管、真空管这样的器件出发，而是先用抽象的&quot;功能部件&quot;来描述机器——这种&quot;按逻辑功能而非物理实现来分层&quot;的思路本身就是一种方法论。这份 1945 年的报告把通用计算机拆成五大部件，规定了它们之间的数据流，由此奠定了此后八十年绝大多数计算机的基本骨架。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>这篇报告的核心，是用三组概念把一台通用计算机讲清楚：<strong>功能分部件</strong>（运算器、控制器、存储器、输入、输出，各司其职）、<strong>顺序取指执行</strong>（控制器以程序计数器驱动取指—解码—执行—写回的循环）、<strong>单一存储器与单一通道</strong>（指令数据同存，既是通用性之源，也是&quot;冯·诺依曼瓶颈&quot;之根）。下文依次展开这三组概念，并落到它们示范的&quot;逻辑与实现解耦&quot;的方法论上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"五大功能部件\">五大功能部件</h2><p>冯·诺依曼把机器分成五个逻辑单元，每个单元只负责一类职责：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>部件</th>\n<th>职责</th>\n<th>现代对应</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>运算器（CA, Central Arithmetic）</td>\n<td>执行算术与逻辑运算</td>\n<td>ALU</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>控制器（CC, Central Control）</td>\n<td>取指、解码、指挥其余部件</td>\n<td>控制单元</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>存储器（M, Memory）</td>\n<td>同时存放指令与数据</td>\n<td>主存 RAM</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>输入（I, Input）</td>\n<td>把外部数据送入存储器</td>\n<td>键盘、磁盘读</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>输出（O, Output）</td>\n<td>把结果送出机器</td>\n<td>屏幕、磁盘写</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>报告里有意类比人脑：运算器和控制器合起来像&quot;神经系统&quot;，存储器像&quot;记忆&quot;，输入输出像感官与肌肉。这种类比不是修辞——它反映了冯·诺依曼一以贯之的方法：先找到不同系统之间的结构相似性，再用统一的形式语言去描述它们。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  I[输入设备] --&gt; M[存储器&lt;br/&gt;指令与数据同存]&#10;  M &lt;--&gt; CC[控制器&lt;br/&gt;取指 解码 指挥]&#10;  M &lt;--&gt; CA[运算器&lt;br/&gt;算术与逻辑]&#10;  CC --&gt; CA&#10;  CA --&gt; M&#10;  M --&gt; O[输出设备]\">flowchart TD\n  I[输入设备] --&gt; M[存储器&lt;br/&gt;指令与数据同存]\n  M &lt;--&gt; CC[控制器&lt;br/&gt;取指 解码 指挥]\n  M &lt;--&gt; CA[运算器&lt;br/&gt;算术与逻辑]\n  CC --&gt; CA\n  CA --&gt; M\n  M --&gt; O[输出设备]</pre><h2 id=\"顺序取指与执行模型\">顺序取指与执行模型</h2><p>这台机器的运转节奏是严格的顺序循环，由控制器驱动。它维护一个指向&quot;下一条指令&quot;的程序计数器，反复执行四个阶段：取指、解码、执行、写回。形式上，一个执行步可以写作：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>fetch</mtext><mo>:</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>←</mo><mi>M</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mtext>decode</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>I</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mtext>execute</mtext><mtext>  </mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>P</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>←</mo><mi>P</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{fetch}: I \\leftarrow M[PC] \\;\\to\\; \\text{decode}(I) \\;\\to\\; \\text{execute} \\;\\to\\; PC \\leftarrow PC + 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">fetch</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">←</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">decode</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">execute</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">←</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>普通指令让 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">PC</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 自然加一，控制因而&quot;顺序流动&quot;；条件跳转指令则根据运算结果把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">PC</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 设成别的地址，让控制&quot;分支&quot;。正是这套&quot;默认顺序、按需跳转&quot;的机制，让循环、判断、子程序调用都能用同一种存储器里的指令字表达——这与上一篇 <a href=\"program-as-data\">程序即数据</a> 描述的同构性是一体两面。</p>\n<h2 id=\"冯-诺依曼瓶颈\">冯·诺依曼瓶颈</h2><p>这套架构有一个与生俱来的代价。指令和数据共用同一块存储器、并共用一条把存储器和处理器连起来的通道。于是无论取指令还是取数据，都要排队走这同一条路。当处理器越来越快、存储器和总线相对越来越慢时，处理器大量时间都在&quot;等数据从存储器过来&quot;——这就是 1977 年由 John Backus 在图灵奖演讲中正式命名的&quot;冯·诺依曼瓶颈&quot;。</p>\n<p>可以粗略地建模：设处理器每秒能执行 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 次运算，但每次运算平均需要从存储器搬运 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 个字，而总线每秒只能搬运 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 个字，则有效吞吐被压到</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>throughput</mtext><mo>≤</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mfrac><mi>B</mi><mi>w</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{throughput} \\le \\min\\left(f, \\; \\frac{B}{w}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">throughput</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>w</mi><mo>≪</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B/w \\ll f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≪</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 时，再快的处理器也跑不满。八十年来计算机体系结构的许多重大进展，本质上都是在和这个瓶颈搏斗：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>多级缓存</strong>：在处理器和主存之间加入小而快的存储，减少走慢通道的次数。</li>\n<li><strong>哈佛架构变体</strong>：把指令和数据的通道分开，让取指和取数据可以并行。</li>\n<li><strong>流水线与乱序执行</strong>：在等待存储器时让处理器去做别的工作。</li>\n<li><strong>近数据计算 / 存内计算</strong>：干脆把运算搬到离数据更近的地方。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>值得注意的是，瓶颈恰恰来自那个最优雅的设计决策——指令与数据共存。这是工程上经典的取舍：换来了通用性与简洁，付出的是带宽上的长期约束。</p>\n<h2 id=\"抽象分层作为方法\">抽象分层作为方法</h2><p>这篇报告真正历久弥新的，不只是这五个盒子，而是它示范的方法：用功能抽象把复杂系统切成职责单一、接口清晰的部件，并把&quot;逻辑设计&quot;与&quot;物理实现&quot;彻底解耦。今天我们谈指令集架构与微架构的分离、谈软硬件接口契约，都站在这一思路之上。冯·诺依曼在量子力学、博弈论里反复使用的也是同一招——先建立干净的形式结构，再让具体内容去填充。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>《EDVAC 报告草案》把通用计算机抽象成运算器、控制器、存储器、输入、输出五大功能部件，规定了它们之间的数据流。</li>\n<li>控制器以程序计数器驱动&quot;取指—解码—执行—写回&quot;的顺序循环，条件跳转让控制得以分支，循环与子程序由此自然成立。</li>\n<li>指令与数据共用存储器和通道带来&quot;冯·诺依曼瓶颈&quot;，缓存、流水线、哈佛变体等体系结构进展都是对它的回应。</li>\n<li>报告最深远的遗产是&quot;按功能抽象分层、逻辑与实现解耦&quot;的方法论，详见 <a href=\"../../core-contributions/the-von-neumann-architecture/architecture-of-computers\">核心贡献·计算机的体系结构</a> 与 <a href=\"../../major-works/the-edvac-report/blueprint-of-the-computer\">代表作·EDVAC 报告</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"计算的架构：五大部件与冯·诺依曼瓶颈","id":"计算的架构-五大部件与冯-诺依曼瓶颈"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"五大功能部件","id":"五大功能部件"},{"level":2,"text":"顺序取指与执行模型","id":"顺序取指与执行模型"},{"level":2,"text":"冯·诺依曼瓶颈","id":"冯-诺依曼瓶颈"},{"level":2,"text":"抽象分层作为方法","id":"抽象分层作为方法"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"程序即数据：把指令写进存储器","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/john-von-neumann/ideas-and-methods/the-stored-program/program-as-data"},"next":{"title":"博弈论的推理：把\"对手会怎么想\"变成数学","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/john-von-neumann/ideas-and-methods/strategic-thinking/game-theoretic-reasoning"}}